an><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/porachki\">← <!-- -->Поръчки</a></p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Червени флагове за цялата страна</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Риск в обществените поръчки</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Всеки договор от ЦАИС ЕОП (<!-- -->244 271<!-- -->, сключени от <!-- -->2020<!-- --> г. насам) получава индекс на риска от 0 до 100 по червените флагове на OLAF и Европейската комисия. Тук са най-рисковите възложители, фирми и договори.</div></div></div><section class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4 mb-10 max-w-4xl text-[15px]\"><p><b>Как да се чете.</b> Високият риск (45+ точки) означава, че в договора се срещат няколко признака, които в практиката на ЕС често съпътстват злоупотреби. Това е списък за проверка, не обвинение. Обратното също е вярно: договор без флагове може да е проблемен по причини, които данните не показват. <a href=\"/porachki/metodologiya\">Методология: как се смята всеки сигнал и кога греши</a>.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-2\">Сигналът е повод за въпрос, не доказателство за нарушение.<!-- --> <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/metodologiya#signal\">Как работим със сигналите</a></p></section><section class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4 lg:grid-cols-4 mb-10\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Висок риск</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.6rem] sm:text-[2.2rem] leading-none mt-1 break-words\">19 671</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted\">8,1%<!-- --> от договорите <!-- -->· 45+ точки</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Среден риск</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.6rem] sm:text-[2.2rem] leading-none mt-1 break-words\">72 574</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted\">29,7%<!-- --> от договорите <!-- -->· 20–44 точки</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Нисък риск</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.6rem] sm:text-[2.2rem] leading-none mt-1 break-words\">14 364</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted\">5,9%<!-- --> от договорите <!-- -->· под 20 точки</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Без флагове</p><p class=\"display num text-[1.6rem] sm:text-[2.2rem] leading-none mt-1 break-words\">137 662</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted\">56,4%<!-- --> от договорите </p></div></section><section class=\"mb-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Колко често се среща всеки флаг</h2></div><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Само една оферта</span><span class=\"num\">81 127<!-- --> · <!-- -->33,2%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:33.211883522808684%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Цена почти равна на прогнозата при един участник</span><span class=\"num\">35 860<!-- --> · <!-- -->14,7%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:14.680416422743592%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Без открит конкурс</span><span class=\"num\">26 698<!-- --> · <!-- -->10,9%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:10.929664184450877%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Над прогнозната стойност</span><span class=\"num\">9968<!-- --> · <!-- -->4,1%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:4.080713633628225%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Цена точно под прага</span><span class=\"num\">5956<!-- --> · <!-- -->2,4%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:2.438275521858919%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Отстранени конкуренти, остава един</span><span class=\"num\">3691<!-- --> · <!-- -->1,5%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:1.5110266875724092%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Изпълнител, свързан с политик</span><span class=\"num\">3379<!-- --> · <!-- -->1,4%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:1.383299695829632%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Оскъпяване с анекси над 10%</span><span class=\"num\">3034<!-- --> · <!-- -->1,2%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:1.2420631184217528%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Законово обяснение (борса, монопол, закон)</span><span class=\"num\">2056<!-- --> · <!-- -->0,8%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:0.8416881250742004%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Възможна връзка с длъжностно лице (по имена)</span><span class=\"num\">1199<!-- --> · <!-- -->0,5%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:0.49084827916535323%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Нова фирма (до година преди договора)</span><span class=\"num\">955<!-- --> · <!-- -->0,4%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:0.39095922152036056%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Кратък срок за оферти</span><span class=\"num\">430<!-- --> · <!-- -->0,2%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:0.17603399503011%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Над 50% подизпълнители</span><span class=\"num\">173<!-- --> · <!-- -->0,1%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:0.07082297939583496%\"></div></div></li><li class=\"text-[15px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Чести промени в условията</span><span class=\"num\">94<!-- --> · <!-- -->0%</span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-red\" style=\"width:0.03848185007634963%\"></div></div></li></ul></div><div><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">По години</h2></div><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Възложители с най-много пари в рискови договори</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-3\">Само възложители с поне 20 договора.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-[15px] num\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left border-b border-rule text-sm text-muted\"><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Възложител</th><th class=\"text-right px-2\">Договори</th><th class=\"text-right px-2\">Общо</th><th class=\"text-right px-2\">С висок риск</th><th class=\"text-right px-2\">Сума с висок риск</th><th class=\"text-right px-2\">Една оферта</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1.5 pr-3\"><a href=\"/porachki/vazlozhitel/000695089\">АГЕНЦИЯ &quot;ПЪТНА ИНФРАСТРУКТУРА&quot;</a><span class=\"block text-xs text-muted\">Столична<!-- -->, <!-- -->София (столица)</span></td><td class=\"text-right px-2\">1184</td><td class=\"text-right px-2\">4 995 490 252 €</td><td class=\"text-right px-2\">75<!-- --> (<!-- -->6,3%<!-- -->)